      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How long has it been like this?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:34",
      "end_timestamp": "00:37",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Let me think, I've had it since Friday. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I've also had a cough at night, since last Tuesday.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:52",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:53",
      "end_timestamp": "01:03",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day. It just comes and goes. I did try to ignore it for a while. Oh, and food coming back up. That's been about the same, about four days. And chest discomfort after eating, too.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:04",
      "end_timestamp": "01:30",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]",
        "symptoms[2]",
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:39",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Right, it feels severe to me. Only antacids, and it's not much.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:40",
      "end_timestamp": "01:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you had any black stools or anaemia?",
